From 662c291e6cf78ef7e8debef4e1f9a4bf1b6460d8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: genspark_dev <genspark_dev@genspark.ai>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 01:57:21 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Let a referral be called off, and give the reports an
 explicit audience

A sent referral had no exit. Add cancellation with a mandatory reason, refused on a
completed referral, recorded on the correspondence trail, and excluded from the open
set so it stops blocking a closure.

Reports shipped with no roles attached, which leaves report access implicit. Add a
post-migrate step that attaches the correspondence roles and System Manager. The JSON
stays role-free on purpose: migrate syncs it before those roles exist.

Two modules appended activity rows with different argument orders. Keep one
implementation, and have both delegate to it.
